### Register (crear usuario)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Elian",
  "email": "Elian@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Login (obtén token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Elian@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

